#ASSERT NOT `the claim is covered` (`a claim under` (`a contract built from` (YMD 2026 1 1) (YMD 2026 12 31) (YMD 2026 1 1) NOTHING 20 20 `all seven benefits` EMPTY `the scenario schedule` FALSE FALSE FALSE 3640000 TRUE (JUST 25000)) `by` `the employee` `for` (`an accident on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `with` (LIST `taking part in an activity` `football` TRUE FALSE TRUE)) `on` `Benefit 1` `for` (`death` FALSE) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1))
#ASSERT NOT `the special cases clause bars` (`a claim under` (`a contract built from` (YMD 2026 1 1) (YMD 2026 12 31) (YMD 2026 1 1) NOTHING 20 20 `all seven benefits` EMPTY `the scenario schedule` FALSE FALSE FALSE 3640000 TRUE (JUST 25000)) `by` `the employee` `for` (`an accident on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `with` (LIST `taking part in an activity` `football` TRUE FALSE TRUE)) `on` `Benefit 1` `for` (`death` FALSE) `on` (YMD 2026 6 1))

§§ `X28 — a spouse of 65: III.1 admits, definition 40 does not`

-- III.1 bars only those who have reached 66 on first joining; def 40 admits a spouse only
-- under 65. An employee joining at 65 is insurable; a spouse joining at 65 is not.
#ASSERT `insurable under III.1` (`a person built from` `an employee` (YMD 1961 1 1) (YMD 2026 1 1) TRUE (YMD 2026 1 1) TRUE TRUE FALSE 0 TRUE FALSE FALSE NOTHING)
#ASSERT NOT `insurable under III.1` (`a person built from` `a spouse` (YMD 1961 1 1) (YMD 2026 1 1) TRUE (YMD 2026 1 1) TRUE TRUE FALSE 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE NOTHING)

